  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fact-finding mission opportunities Geodata and agricultural development in Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project has two main objectives:1. To assist the Angolan authorities in accelerating the development of their agricultural sector by providing satellite information services. The Angolan authorities consider satellite information as an essential tool in this process.2. To promote and support the Dutch value-adding sector (specifically, their satellite information services) in expanding their business in Africa.This project aims to enhance the output of the agricultural sector by providing food producers with relevant, specific, and timely information. This will lead to improved sustainable food production and increased efficiency in the use of inputs for food production.</narrative>
  </description>
